  "source_conventions": [
    "Printed endpoint precision is one decimal degree;input domain is integertenths0..3599.",
    "Both printed endpoints included on this discrete domain;onlyN2 crosses north.",
    "Table order startsS1 and continues cyclically;it is not a north-up spatial grid.",
    "The illustrated smartphone reads92°/E;E2 is independently derived from its printed interval,not written on the phone.",
    "Magnetic/true reference and measurement role are not established by numeric table membership. No physical conversion or calibrated building orientation is inferred.",
    "A150-point discrete interval has two central valid points;its exact geometric midpoint is half a tenth and is not a supported heading input."
